k84fbdf76.pt:
O sol nasce sobre Morkath e a cidade já sabe. Grupos pequenos nas esquinas — três pescadores aqui, duas viúvas ali, um ferreiro que ninguém contratava há meses. Ninguém grita. Todos comentam.

As notícias chegam antes de você:
— os três Conselheiros do Vazio, mortos no Salão do Silêncio;
— Kaevoss, o Sem-Nome, ferido, fugido, sem sucessor imediato;
— um estrangeiro, sozinho, atravessando o pátio do Salão como quem atravessa uma cozinha depois do jantar, ileso.

Um mensageiro passa por você em direção à Regência de Morkath. Carrega três selos diferentes na sacola. Um deles é para o Regente Voreth Karn — o primeiro Regente em três gerações que talvez precise governar de verdade.

k84fbdf76.en:
The sun rises over Morkath and the city already knows. Small groups on the corners — three fishermen here, two widows there, a blacksmith no one had hired in months. No one shouts. Everyone talks.

The news arrives before you do:
— the three Councilors of the Void, dead in the Hall of Silence;
— Kaevoss, the Nameless, wounded, fled, with no immediate successor;
— a stranger, alone, crossing the Hall's courtyard like someone crossing a kitchen after dinner, unharmed.

A messenger passes you heading for the Regency of Morkath. He carries three different seals in his bag. One of them is for Regent Voreth Karn — the first Regent in three generations who may actually need to govern.

kb2d554a9.pt:
.fd-palco{--fd-c:255,240,200;position:relative;width:100%;max-width:372px;margin:0 auto;overflow:hidden;touch-action:pan-y}
.fd-trilho{display:flex;width:100%;transition:transform .5s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}
.fd-palco[data-v="1"] .fd-trilho{transform:translateX(-100%)}
.fd-palco[data-v="2"] .fd-trilho{transform:translateX(-200%)}
.fd-slide{flex:0 0 100%;min-width:0;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 38px}
.fd-slide .anjo-vitrine,.fd-slide .fam-vitrine{flex:none}
.fd-seta{position:absolute;top:50%;margin-top:-26px;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;padding:0 0 3px;cursor:pointer;z-index:5;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  border:1px solid rgba(var(--fd-c),.75);background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(var(--fd-c),.36),rgba(24,20,14,.8));color:#fff6e0;font:26px/1 Georgia,serif;
  box-shadow:0 0 7px rgba(var(--fd-c),.5);transition:opacity .25s,filter .15s}
.fd-seta:hover{filter:brightness(1.2)}
.fd-seta.dir{right:7px;animation:fdNudge 1.5s ease-in-out infinite}
.fd-seta.esq{left:7px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
.fd-palco:not([data-v="0"]) .fd-seta.dir{animation:none}
.fd-palco.fd-ultima .fd-seta.dir{opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
.fd-palco:not([data-v="0"]) .fd-seta.esq{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}
/* 3ª página: a narrativa do cartão, sozinha */
.fd-slide.s3{padding-top:6px;padding-bottom:6px}
.fd-narr-tit{font:700 9.5px Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgb(var(--fd-c));
  text-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(var(--fd-c),.6);margin:0 0 8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.fd-narr-tit::before,.fd-narr-tit::after{content:"";width:22px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(var(--fd-c),.8))}
.fd-narr-tit::after{transform:scaleX(-1)}
.fd-slide.s3 .anjo-narrativa,.fd-slide.s3 .fam-narrativa{margin:0;max-width:440px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.62;padding:10px 12px}
@keyframes fdNudge{50%{transform:translateX(4px)}}
.fd-pontos{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:5px 0 2px}
.fd-pontos button{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;padding:0;border:0;background:rgba(var(--fd-c),.3);cursor:pointer}
.fd-pontos button.on{background:rgb(var(--fd-c));box-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(var(--fd-c),.9)}
.fd-pontos em{font:italic 10.5px Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;color:rgb(var(--fd-c));margin-left:4px}

.fd-cena{--u:40px;position:relative;width:100%;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(var(--fd-c),.4);background:#07060b;
  box-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(var(--fd-c),.25),inset 0 0 24px rgba(0,0,0,.7);cursor:pointer;isolation:isolate;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}
.fd-cena *{pointer-events:none}
.fd-heroi{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;will-change:transform,opacity}
.fd-heroi canvas{display:block}
.fd-fx{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:5}
.fd-chip{position:absolute;left:6px;top:6px;z-index:6;font:700 9.5px Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:.04em;color:#e8e0f0;background:rgba(10,8,16,.72);
  border:1px solid rgba(220,210,240,.3);padding:2px 7px;border-radius:9px}
.fd-btn{position:absolute;left:8px;bottom:8px;z-index:6;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;padding:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  border:1px solid rgba(var(--fd-c),.6);background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(var(--fd-c),.25),rgba(20,18,30,.85));color:#fff6d8;font:16px/1 serif;transition:transform .1s}
.fd-btn.on{box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(var(--fd-c),.95);background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(var(--fd-c),.6),rgba(60,50,30,.85))}
.fd-btn.press{transform:scale(.84)}
.fd-toque{position:absolute;left:8px;bottom:8px;z-index:6;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid rgba(255,244,205,.95);opacity:0}
.fd-fade{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:10;background:#000;opacity:1}
.fd-leg{width:100%;padding-top:7px;text-align:center}
.fd-leg p{margin:0;min-height:32px;font:12px/1.35 Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;color:#f1e3c0;text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.7);animation:fdLeg .45s ease-out}
.fd-leg p b{color:#fff3cf;margin-right:4px;text-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(var(--fd-c),.85)}
@keyframes fdLeg{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.fd-passos{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:5px;margin-top:2px}
.fd-passos i{width:16px;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:rgba(var(--fd-c),.2);transition:background .3s}
.fd-passos i.on{background:rgb(var(--fd-c));box-shadow:0 0 5px rgba(var(--fd-c),.8)}
.sem-heroi .fd-heroi::after{content:"🧍";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:5%;text-align:center;font-size:calc(var(--u)*1.1)}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.fd-seta.dir,.fd-leg p{animation:none}.fd-trilho{transition:none}}

